                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Space Ranger ASK - a great space shooter!\n\nIn the game you have to perform various tasks on your spacecraft and defend the base. You are required to save astronauts, fight evil aliens, destroy asteroids and defeat bosses.\nWe fly and distribute aliens under the real rave of the 90s from Ian Frank!\nYou can collect various improvements and bonuses for your ship. With them to carry out the mission will be even more interesting and exciting!\nAlso in the game there is a full-featured level editor in which you can create missions for every taste!\n\nI consider the main features of this project:\n- A variety of action levels\n- A lot of enemies, bosses and bonuses\n- Level Editor\n- Support Steam Workshop\n- Statistics of achievements\n- Great retro soundtrack\n- Ability to control from the keyboard, mouse and gamepad.\n\nExcellent arcade from the 90s for lovers of the classics!",
